Under the Freedom of Information Act 2014, I request the following records:
• A copy of the most up-to-date version of the risk register;
• A copy of the most up-to-date tracker for the implementation of recommendations from
audits;
• A list of all internal audits carried out in the last two years to include the month and year of
the audit and the overall assurance rating;
• A copy of the three most recent internal audits;
• A copy of the minutes of the last five audit and risk committee (ARC) meetings
